  "implementation": "Reuse existing curve closest-parameter, surface/trimmed-face closest-parameter and indexed mesh closest-location queries. Preserve all stored point/cloud/mesh occurrences and sample other sources through existing arc-length or display tessellation paths. Use exact finite-value means and scaled population variance, deterministic target ties and bounded batch sizes. Cache samples by immutable source/target snapshots, tolerance and sampling; cache statistics by sample storage and Ignore. Share the existing two-set viewport picker and add a non-destructive analysis panel, colored/exaggerated distance hairs and atomic permanent-line creation.",
